node_modules/

# Full-resolution originals are NOT committed — they live on your machine.
# The repo tracks only the web-sized copies in images/_web/, which is what
# the site actually serves. Keeps the repository small and fast to clone.
#
# Because of this, run `node build.mjs` (or build.bat) BEFORE pushing, so the
# web copies of any new photo are generated and committed. The GitHub Action
# can't do it for you — it never sees the originals.
#
# Keep your own backup of images/. Git is not backing it up.
images/*
!images/_web/
